#: source/installation/multi-user.md:63
msgid "Restricting access"
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/multi-user.md:65
msgid ""
"To limit which users can perform Nix operations, you can use the permissions "
"on the directory `/nix/var/nix/daemon-socket`. For instance, if you want to "
"restrict the use of Nix to the members of a group called `nix-users`, do"
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/multi-user.md:75
msgid ""
"This way, users who are not in the `nix-users` group cannot connect to the "
"Unix domain socket `/nix/var/nix/daemon-socket/socket`, so they cannot "
"perform Nix operations."
msgstr ""
